BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:salamis-selinia-feast-of-panagia-therapevousa-agios-nikolaos-selinia-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270630
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270702
SUMMARY:Feast of Panagia Therapevousa\, Agios Nikolaos\, Selinia
LOCATION:Selinia\, Salamina\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The seaside parish of Agios Nikolaos in Selinia\, on the east coast facing Piraeus\, keeps the feast of its icon of Panagia Therapevousa (the Healer) on 30 June-1 July: vespers with artoklasia at 7 pm on the eve\, liturgy at 7 am and a procession of the icon along the waterfront. The same church holds a relic of St Nicholas and celebrates again on 5-6 December.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/salamis/#selinia-feast-of-panagia-therapevousa-agios-nikolaos-selinia
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/salamis/#selinia-feast-of-panagia-therapevousa-agios-nikolaos-selinia
END:VEVENT
