SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Faneromeni\, Faneromeni Monastery
LOCATION:Faneromeni\, Salamina\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The biggest event on Salamina: the 16th-century monastery of Faneromeni on the north-west coast\, opposite Megara\, keeps the Apodosis of the Dormition on 23 August with a vigil on the 22nd\, a procession of the miraculous icon and tens of thousands of pilgrims\, many of whom walk through the night from Paloukia\; a fair with stalls and food lines the road to the monastery. Extra buses run from Paloukia and the Perama ferry\; go on the eve for the atmosphere.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/salamis/#faneromeni-panigiri-of-panagia-faneromeni-faneromeni-monaste
