BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:salamis-salamina-town-feast-of-agios-minas-patron-salamina-town-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271112
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Minas (patron)\, Salamina Town
LOCATION:Salamina Town\, Salamina\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Agios Minas is the patron of Salamina and his metropolitan church in the town centre keeps 10-11 November with vespers\, an episcopal liturgy by the Metropolitan of Megara and Salamina and a procession of the icon through the streets\, followed by the town's autumn fair. Twenty minutes from Piraeus by ferry\, so an easy half-day.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/salamis/#salamina-town-feast-of-agios-minas-patron-salamina-town
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/salamis/#salamina-town-feast-of-agios-minas-patron-salamina-town
END:VEVENT
